5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to know if our past efforts actually changed patient outcomes before adding more.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The infrastructure must absorb the new load without seizing up. I am concerned about capacity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Approval is easy; failure in year two is the real risk. I want to see where things broke.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Rosters are where the pressure lands. I need to see the staffing records clearly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must understand the true cost and return. I want to see the financial reality.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, do you have specific examples of recent failures you are referring to?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, staffing is critical, but physical space is equally limiting. We must check both.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, yes, but I am looking for structural causes, not just anecdotes.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I agree. If the rooms are full, the staff cannot work effectively.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will look at the ledger to see what we can actually afford to build.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will review the readmission figures to see if previous trials had lasting impact.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the booking system to see how much unlogged work exists.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the board minutes regarding the jointly run clinic closure.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will examine the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover costs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also check the regional fund tariffs to understand revenue potential.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,That covers my initial questions. I am ready to review the data.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let us see what the records say before we speculate further.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am confident the minutes will reveal the pattern of shared responsibility failure.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope the staffing data shows where the real strain is located.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,A clear picture of costs and revenues is essential for a sustainable decision.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
