60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate D, Chronic Care Coordination, addresses the readmission drift and appointment consolidation.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,It fits within existing infrastructure if we use the booking system correctly for coordinators.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
