74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I will vote for D. It aligns with the financial reality of the budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,It seems we are unanimous. D is the clear choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Let us proceed with the vote.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
